#: ../../library/queue.rst:76
msgid ""
"Constructor for an unbounded :abbr:`FIFO (first-in, first-out)` queue. "
"Simple queues lack advanced functionality such as task tracking."
msgstr ""
"Konstruktor pro neomezené :abbr:`FIFO (first-in, first-out)` frontu. "
"Jednoduché fronty postrádají pokročilé funkce jako správa úkolů."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:84
msgid ""
"Exception raised when non-blocking :meth:`~Queue.get` (or "
":meth:`~Queue.get_nowait`) is called on a :class:`Queue` object which is "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"Výjimka vyvolaná, když se volá neblokující :meth:`~Queue.get` (nebo "
":meth:`~Queue.get_nowait`) na objektu :class:`Queue`, který je prázdný."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:91
msgid ""
"Exception raised when non-blocking :meth:`~Queue.put` (or "
":meth:`~Queue.put_nowait`) is called on a :class:`Queue` object which is "
"full."
msgstr ""
"Výjimka vyvolaná, když se volá neblokující :meth:`~Queue.put` (nebo "
":meth:`~Queue.put_nowait`) na objektu :class:`Queue`, který je plný."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:98
msgid ""
"Exception raised when :meth:`~Queue.put` or :meth:`~Queue.get` is called on "
"a :class:`Queue` object which has been shut down."
msgstr ""
"Výjimka vyvolaná, když se volá :meth:`~Queue.put` nebo :meth:`~Queue.get` na"
" objektu :class:`Queue`, který byl vypnut."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:107
msgid "Queue Objects"
msgstr "Objekty fronty"

#: ../../library/queue.rst:109
msgid ""
"Queue objects (:class:`Queue`, :class:`LifoQueue`, or "
":class:`PriorityQueue`) provide the public methods described below."
msgstr ""
"Objekty fronty (:class:`Queue`, :class:`LifoQueue`, nebo "
":class:`PriorityQueue`) poskytují veřejné metody popsáné níže."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:115
msgid ""
"Return the approximate size of the queue.  Note, qsize() > 0 doesn't "
"guarantee that a subsequent get() will not block, nor will qsize() < maxsize"
" guarantee that put() will not block."
msgstr ""
"Vrátí přibližnou velikost fronty. Poznámka, qsize() > 0 negarančuje, že "
"následné get() se nezablokuje, ani qsize() < maxsize negarančuje, že put() "
"se nezablokuje."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:122
msgid ""
"Return ``True`` if the queue is empty, ``False`` otherwise.  If empty() "
"returns ``True`` it doesn't guarantee that a subsequent call to put() will "
"not block.  Similarly, if empty() returns ``False`` it doesn't guarantee "
"that a subsequent call to get() will not block."
msgstr ""
"Vrátí ``True``, pokud je fronta prázdná, jinak ``False``. Pokud empty() "
"vrátí ``True``, negarančuje to, že následné volání put() se nezablokuje. "
"Podobně, pokud empty() vrátí ``False``, negarančuje to, že následné volání "
"get() se nezablokuje."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:130
msgid ""
"Return ``True`` if the queue is full, ``False`` otherwise.  If full() "
"returns ``True`` it doesn't guarantee that a subsequent call to get() will "
"not block.  Similarly, if full() returns ``False`` it doesn't guarantee that"
" a subsequent call to put() will not block."
msgstr ""
"Vrátí ``True``, pokud je fronta plná, jinak ``False``. Pokud full() vrátí "
"``True``, negarančuje to, že následné volání get() se nezablokuje. Podobně, "
"pokud full() vrátí ``False``, negarančuje to, že následné volání put() se "
"nezablokuje."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:138
msgid ""
"Put *item* into the queue.  If optional args *block* is true and *timeout* "
"is ``None`` (the default), block if necessary until a free slot is "
"available.  If *timeout* is a positive number, it blocks at most *timeout* "
"seconds and raises the :exc:`Full` exception if no free slot was available "
"within that time. Otherwise (*block* is false), put an item on the queue if "
"a free slot is immediately available, else raise the :exc:`Full` exception "
"(*timeout* is ignored in that case)."
msgstr ""
"Vloží *item* do fronty. Pokud je volitelný argument *block* pravda a "
"*timeout* je ``None`` (výchozí), blokuje se v případě potřeby, dokud není "
"dostupné volné místo. Pokud *timeout* je kladné číslo, blokuje se nejvýše po"
" dobu *timeout* sekund a vyvolá výjimku :exc:`Full`, pokud není volné místo "
"dostupné v této době. Jinak (*block* je nepravda), vloží položku do fronty, "
"pokud je volné místo okamžitě dostupné, jinak vyvolá výjimku :exc:`Full` "
"(*timeout* je v tom případě ignorován)."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:146
msgid "Raises :exc:`ShutDown` if the queue has been shut down."
msgstr "Vyvolá :exc:`ShutDown`, pokud byla fronta vypnuta."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:151
msgid "Equivalent to ``put(item, block=False)``."
msgstr "Ekvivalentní k ``put(item, block=False)``."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:156 ../../library/queue.rst:314
msgid ""
"Remove and return an item from the queue.  If optional args *block* is true "
"and *timeout* is ``None`` (the default), block if necessary until an item is"
" available. If *timeout* is a positive number, it blocks at most *timeout* "
"seconds and raises the :exc:`Empty` exception if no item was available "
"within that time. Otherwise (*block* is false), return an item if one is "
"immediately available, else raise the :exc:`Empty` exception (*timeout* is "
"ignored in that case)."
msgstr ""
"Odebere a vrátí položku z fronty. Pokud je volitelný argument *block* pravda"
" a *timeout* je ``None`` (výchozí), blokuje se v případě potřeby, dokud není"
" dostupná položka. Pokud *timeout* je kladné číslo, blokuje se nejvýše po "
"dobu *timeout* sekund a vyvolá výjimku :exc:`Empty`, pokud není položka "
"dostupná v této době. Jinak (*block* je nepravda), vrátí položku, pokud je "
"okamžitě dostupná, jinak vyvolá výjimku :exc:`Empty` (*timeout* je v tom "
"případě ignorován)."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:163
msgid ""
"Prior to 3.0 on POSIX systems, and for all versions on Windows, if *block* "
"is true and *timeout* is ``None``, this operation goes into an "
"uninterruptible wait on an underlying lock.  This means that no exceptions "
"can occur, and in particular a SIGINT will not trigger a "
":exc:`KeyboardInterrupt`."
msgstr ""
"Před verzemi 3.0 na systémech POSIX a ve všech verzích na Windows, pokud je "
"*block* pravda a *timeout* je ``None``, tato operace vstoupil do "
"neperušitelného čekání na podkladové úzyem. To znamená, že nemohou nastat "
"žádné výjimky a zejména SIGINT nebude spáchat :exc:`KeyboardInterrupt`."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:168
msgid ""
"Raises :exc:`ShutDown` if the queue has been shut down and is empty, or if "
"the queue has been shut down immediately."
msgstr ""
"Vyvolá :exc:`ShutDown`, pokud byla fronta vypnuta a je prázdná, nebo pokud "
"byla fronta vypnuta okamžitě."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:174 ../../library/queue.rst:324
msgid "Equivalent to ``get(False)``."
msgstr "Ekvivalentní k ``get(False)``."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:176
msgid ""
"Two methods are offered to support tracking whether enqueued tasks have been"
" fully processed by daemon consumer threads."
msgstr ""
"Dvě metody jsou nabízeny pro podporu sledování, zda byly ve fronty zařazené "
"úkoly plnová zpracovány démonem spotrebících vláken."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:182
msgid ""
"Indicate that a formerly enqueued task is complete.  Used by queue consumer "
"threads.  For each :meth:`get` used to fetch a task, a subsequent call to "
":meth:`task_done` tells the queue that the processing on the task is "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"Uvede, ze drive ve fronty zarazeny ukol je dokoncen. Pouziva se vlakny "
"spotrebici fronty. Pro kazde :meth:`get` pouzite k ziskani ukolu, "
"nasledujici volani :meth:`task_done` sdeli fronte, ze zpracovani ukolu je "
"dokonceno."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:186
msgid ""
"If a :meth:`join` is currently blocking, it will resume when all items have "
"been processed (meaning that a :meth:`task_done` call was received for every"
" item that had been :meth:`put` into the queue)."
msgstr ""
"Pokud :meth:`join` prave blokuje, pokracuje, kdyz byly vsechny prvky "
"zpracovany (to znamena, ze pro kazdy prvek, ktery byl :meth:`put` do fronty,"
" bylo prijato volani :meth:`task_done`)."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:190
msgid ""
"Raises a :exc:`ValueError` if called more times than there were items placed"
" in the queue."
msgstr ""
"Vyvola :exc:`ValueError`, pokud je volano vicekrat, nez bylo polozek "
"umisteno do fronty."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:196
msgid "Blocks until all items in the queue have been gotten and processed."
msgstr "Blokuje, dokud nejsou vsechny prvky ve fronte odebrany a zpracovany."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:198
msgid ""
"The count of unfinished tasks goes up whenever an item is added to the "
"queue. The count goes down whenever a consumer thread calls "
":meth:`task_done` to indicate that the item was retrieved and all work on it"
" is complete.  When the count of unfinished tasks drops to zero, "
":meth:`join` unblocks."
msgstr ""
"Pocet neuzavreny ukolu se zvysil pokazdé, kdyz je prvek pridan do fronty. "
"Pocet se snizil pokazdé, kdyz vlakno spotrebitel zavolá :meth:`task_done`, "
"aby oznamilo, ze prvek byl ziskan a vsechna prace na nem je dokoncena. Kdyz "
"pocet neuzavreny ukolu klesne na nulu, :meth:`join` odblokuje."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:205
msgid "Waiting for task completion"
msgstr "Cekani na zavereseni ukolu"

#: ../../library/queue.rst:207
msgid "Example of how to wait for enqueued tasks to be completed::"
msgstr "Priklad, jak ceklat, az budou zarazene ukoly dokonceny::"

#: ../../library/queue.rst:209
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import threading\n"
"import queue\n"
"\n"
"q = queue.Queue()\n"
"\n"
"def worker():\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        item = q.get()\n"
"        print(f'Working on {item}')\n"
"        print(f'Finished {item}')\n"
"        q.task_done()\n"
"\n"
"# Turn-on the worker thread.\n"
"threading.Thread(target=worker, daemon=True).start()\n"
"\n"
"# Send thirty task requests to the worker.\n"
"for item in range(30):\n"
"    q.put(item)\n"
"\n"
"# Block until all tasks are done.\n"
"q.join()\n"
"print('All work completed')"
msgstr ""
"import threading\n"
"import queue\n"
"\n"
"q = queue.Queue()\n"
"\n"
"def worker():\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        item = q.get()\n"
"        print(f'Working on {item}')\n"
"        print(f'Finished {item}')\n"
"        q.task_done()\n"
"\n"
"# Turn-on the worker thread.\n"
"threading.Thread(target=worker, daemon=True).start()\n"
"\n"
"# Send thirty task requests to the worker.\n"
"for item in range(30):\n"
"    q.put(item)\n"
"\n"
"# Block until all tasks are done.\n"
"q.join()\n"
"print('All work completed')"

#: ../../library/queue.rst:234
msgid "Terminating queues"
msgstr "Ukonceni front"

#: ../../library/queue.rst:236
msgid ""
"When no longer needed, :class:`Queue` objects can be wound down until empty "
"or terminated immediately with a hard shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Kdyz jiz nejsou potrebny, objekty :class:`Queue` mohou byt postupne vypnout "
"az do vyprazdneni nebo okamzite ukonceny s tvrdym vypnutim."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:241
msgid "Put a :class:`Queue` instance into a shutdown mode."
msgstr "Vlozi instanci :class:`Queue` do rezimu vypnuti."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:243
msgid ""
"The queue can no longer grow. Future calls to :meth:`~Queue.put` raise "
":exc:`ShutDown`. Currently blocked callers of :meth:`~Queue.put` will be "
"unblocked and will raise :exc:`ShutDown` in the formerly blocked thread."
msgstr ""
"Fronta jiz nemaze rust. Budouci volani :meth:`~Queue.put` vyvolaji "
":exc:`ShutDown`. Aktualne blokovaní volajici :meth:`~Queue.put` budou "
"odblokovani a vyvolaji :exc:`ShutDown` v drive blokovanem vlakne."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:248
msgid ""
"If *immediate* is false (the default), the queue can be wound down normally "
"with :meth:`~Queue.get` calls to extract tasks that have already been "
"loaded."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je *immediate* nepravda (vychozi), muze byt fronta normalne vypnuta "
"volani :meth:`~Queue.get` k extrahovani ukolu, ktere jiz byly nacteny."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:252
msgid ""
"And if :meth:`~Queue.task_done` is called for each remaining task, a pending"
" :meth:`~Queue.join` will be unblocked normally."
msgstr ""
"A pokud je :meth:`~Queue.task_done` volano pro kazdy zbyvajici ukol, pending"
" :meth:`~Queue.join` bude normalne odblokovano."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:255
msgid ""
"Once the queue is empty, future calls to :meth:`~Queue.get` will raise "
":exc:`ShutDown`."
msgstr ""
"Jakmile je fronta prazdna, budouci volani :meth:`~Queue.get` vyvolaji "
":exc:`ShutDown`."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:258
msgid ""
"If *immediate* is true, the queue is terminated immediately. The queue is "
"drained to be completely empty and the count of unfinished tasks is reduced "
"by the number of tasks drained. If unfinished tasks is zero, callers of "
":meth:`~Queue.join` are unblocked.  Also, blocked callers of "
":meth:`~Queue.get` are unblocked and will raise :exc:`ShutDown` because the "
"queue is empty."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je *immediate* pravda, je fronta okamzite ukoncena. Fronta je "
"vyprazdnena tak, aby byla zcela prazdna a pocet neuzavreny ukolu je snizen "
"poctem vyprazdnenych ukolu. Pokud je pocet neuzavreny ukolu nula, jsou "
"volajici :meth:`~Queue.join` odblokovani. Zaroven jsou odblokovani blokovaní"
" volajici :meth:`~Queue.get` a vyvolaji :exc:`ShutDown`, protoze je fronta "
"prazdna."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:266
msgid ""
"Use caution when using :meth:`~Queue.join` with *immediate* set to true. "
"This unblocks the join even when no work has been done on the tasks, "
"violating the usual invariant for joining a queue."
msgstr ""
"Budte obezretni pri pouzivani :meth:`~Queue.join` s *immediate* nastavenym "
"na pravda. Toto odbloukovava spojeni i kdyz nebyla provedenal zadna prace na"
" ukolech, porusujici obvyklou invariantu pro spojeni fronty."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:274
msgid "SimpleQueue Objects"
msgstr "Objekty SimpleQueue"

#: ../../library/queue.rst:276
msgid ""
":class:`SimpleQueue` objects provide the public methods described below."
msgstr "Objekty :class:`SimpleQueue` poskytují veřejné metody popsáné níže."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:280
msgid ""
"Return the approximate size of the queue.  Note, qsize() > 0 doesn't "
"guarantee that a subsequent get() will not block."
msgstr ""
"Vrati pribliznout velikost fronty. Poznamka, qsize() > 0 negarančuje, ze "
"nasledujici get() se nezablokuje."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:286
msgid ""
"Return ``True`` if the queue is empty, ``False`` otherwise.  If empty() "
"returns ``False`` it doesn't guarantee that a subsequent call to get() will "
"not block."
msgstr ""
"Vrati ``True``, pokud je fronta prazdna, jinak ``False``. Pokud empty() "
"vrati ``False``, negarančuje to, ze nasledujici volani get() se nezablokuje."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:293
msgid ""
"Put *item* into the queue.  The method never blocks and always succeeds "
"(except for potential low-level errors such as failure to allocate memory). "
"The optional args *block* and *timeout* are ignored and only provided for "
"compatibility with :meth:`Queue.put`."
msgstr ""
"Vlozi *item* do fronty. Metoda nikdy neblokuje a vzdy se podari (s vyjimkou "
"moznych chyb nizke urovne, jako je selhani pri alokaci pameti). Volitelne "
"argumenty *block* a *timeout* jsou ignorovany a poskytovany pouze pro "
"kompatibilitu s :meth:`Queue.put`."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:299
msgid ""
"This method has a C implementation which is reentrant.  That is, a ``put()``"
" or ``get()`` call can be interrupted by another ``put()`` call in the same "
"thread without deadlocking or corrupting internal state inside the queue.  "
"This makes it appropriate for use in destructors such as ``__del__`` methods"
" or :mod:`weakref` callbacks."
msgstr ""
"Tato metoda ma implementaci C, ktera je reentrantni. To znamena, ze volani "
"``put()`` nebo ``get()`` muze byt preruseno jinym volanim ``put()`` ve "
"stejnem vlakne bez deadlocku nebo poskozeni interniho stavu fronty. To ji "
"cini vhodnou pro pouziti v destruktory, jako jsou metody ``__del__`` nebo "
"callbacky :mod:`weakref`."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:308
msgid ""
"Equivalent to ``put(item, block=False)``, provided for compatibility with "
":meth:`Queue.put_nowait`."
msgstr ""
"Ekvivalentni k ``put(item, block=False)``, poskytovano pro kompatibilitu s "
":meth:`Queue.put_nowait`."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:329
msgid "Class :class:`multiprocessing.Queue`"
msgstr "Trida :class:`multiprocessing.Queue`"

#: ../../library/queue.rst:330
msgid ""
"A queue class for use in a multi-processing (rather than multi-threading) "
"context."
msgstr ""
"Trida fronty pro pouziti v kontextu viceprocesualnm (spise nez "
"multivlaknovym)."

#: ../../library/queue.rst:333
msgid ""
":class:`collections.deque` is an alternative implementation of unbounded "
"queues with fast atomic :meth:`~collections.deque.append` and "
":meth:`~collections.deque.popleft` operations that do not require locking "
"and also support indexing."
msgstr ""
":class:`collections.deque` je alternativni implementace neomezeny ch front s"
" rychlymi atomovymi operacemi :meth:`~collections.deque.append` a "
":meth:`~collections.deque.popleft`, ktere nevyzaduji zamykani a take "
"podporuji indexovani."
